All content in this repository and on the official site (https://don3nasu-glitch.github.io/danjiri-gp/),
including the game program, 3D models, images, music, songs, voices, commentary scripts, videos, text,
characters, names and logos, is the property of Don Erika.

This repository is public solely to serve the game on the official site. It is NOT open source.
Without prior written permission from the rights holder, you may not:
  - copy, mirror, redistribute, or publish it on any other website or app store;
  - modify or decompile it, or extract and reuse any assets (music, voices, models, images, etc.);
  - make any derivative use, commercial or non-commercial, including use as AI training data.
You are welcome to play on the official site and to share gameplay videos or streams.

Some in-game voices were created with VOICEVOX (credits are shown in the game). Rights to each voice library belong to their respective owners.

